<title>SPAIN: FORECAST- Popular Q1 net seen up 6.1 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST- Popular Q1 net seen up 6.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial analysts forecasts, on average, for first quarter results of Banco Popular Espanol SA,  which are set for release on Wednesday. In billions of pesetas:</p>
<p>				   Q1 1997	Q1 1996     RANGE</p>
<p>    Net interest income    44.62	  44.42     43.90-46.26</p>
<p>    Operating income	 30.65	  30.40     28.45-33.05</p>
<p>    Attributable earnings  15.33	  14.45     15.50-15.30</p>
<p>Contributors: Ahorro Corporacion, Ibersecurities, Benito and Monjardin, Merrill Lynch and Inverban</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
